  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manoa na nke kwisagījiwa ng'wana ngosha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bakandya kwīta yabūbi hangī ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūbatūūla mu makono ga Bafilisiti ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho ngosha ūmò wa mu nzengo gwa Zola, lina lyakwe Manoa; wa mu ndūgū ja banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Dani. Ū ngosha ng'wenūyo walī atoolile, gwike ū nke walī ngūmba, nose walī atī na ng'wana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA akang'wilongela ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla, “Ū bebe ūlī ngūmba alīyo ūkūbūūcha nda ūbyale ng'wana ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ilang'hanage ūtizūng'wa divai nūūlū shikoji shingī shose shose, nūūlū yaya kūlya shikolo shisoso shose shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūkūbūūcha nda ūbyale ng'wana ngosha, ūyo lūgembe lose lose lūtī lo kūbīta mu ntwe gokwe, nguno kūfuma kūbyalwa kwakwe akūbiza Nazili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nazili:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū ng'wihanga lya Baisilaeli banhū bamò baalahīlaga kwilecha mihayo ya kūyeja mīlī, kūlwa kwiyeeja kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; ī shilahīlo shenīsho ī hingī shalī sh'ikanza iguhī, alīyo bangī baalahīlaga kūlwa shikū jose ja būlamu wabo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ng'wela kūlwa ng'wa Mulungu. Ū ng'wenūyo akwandya kūbapīja a Baisilaeli kūfuma ū mu nkono gwa Bafilisiti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūja ū kūlī ngoshi ūūkang'wīla gīkī, “Munhū o ng'wa Mulungu walī wiza aho naalī; ū kw'ihanga lyakwe walī gītī malaika o ng'wa Mulungu, walī wa kogohya no. Naalī naalemeelwa nū kūmūūja ūko walī afumile, nī lina lyakwe ataniwīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike walī waniwīla gīkī, ‘Ūkūbūūcha nda ūbyale ng'wana ngosha. Na lūūlū ilang'hanage ūtizūng'wa divai nūūlū shikoji shingī shose shose, nūūlū yaya kūlya shikolo shisoso shose shose. Nguno ū nyanda ng'wenūyo akūbiza Nazili, ng'wela kūlwa ng'wa Mulungu kūfuma kūbyalwa kwakwe kūshisha lūshikū lwa kūcha kwakwe.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manoa na Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Manoa ūnomba ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Ee SEEBA, nalīkwikūmbīlīja ize hangī ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu ūyo walī watūtūmīlile, atūlangīīle chiza ūmo tūlanang'hanīle ū nyanda ūyo alaabyalwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wigwa ū Manoa, ū malaika o ng'wa Mulungu wiza hangī ūnsanga ū nkīma alī kwilaale, alīyo ū ngoshi ū Manoa wal'atī hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūpeela kūjūng'witana ū ngoshi; ūng'wīla, “Ū munhū ūyo walī waniilongelile lwise lwene ūūyū wiza hangī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Manoa ūbūūka ūnkūūbīja ū nke; aho washika aho walī ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūmūūja, “H'ūlī bebe ūyo walī wizile na lūshikū lūngī ūhooya nū nke wane?” Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Nalī ng'wene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Manoa ūmūūja, “Eehe ūlū yūshikīīla ī mihayo yako, ū nyanda ng'wenūyo shiigelile abize na kikalīle ka mbika kī, nū nīmo gwakwe gūkūbiza nīmo kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika o ng'wa SEEBA ūnshokeja ūhaya, “Ū nke wako shing'wigeleelilwe wīshikīlīje pyī īyo nang'wīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizūlya shose shosse īsho shifumile mu matwajo ga mizabibu, yaya nūūlū kūng'wa divai, nūūlū shikoji shingī shose shose, hangī yaya nūūlū kūlya shikolo shisoso shose shose. Shing'wigelile ayīshikīlīje pyī ī yose īyo naanangīīlile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Manoa ūng'wīla ū malaika o ng'wa SEEBA gīkī, “Tūtogilwe wikale ho kakanza tūkūbeegeje kakūbī ka nyama ya mbūli songi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika o ng'wa SEEBA ūhaya, “Mukūnitindīka dalali dūhū, nguno nūūlū mukabeeja naaheene natīīko ū kūshilya ī shilīwa shing'we. Alīyo ūlū mulashibeeje shifunyagi kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA.” (Ū Manoa walī ataadeebaga gīkī walī malaika o ng'wa SEEBA.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Manoa ūmūūja ū malaika o ng'wa SEEBA, “Ī lina lyako ūlī nani, tūlakūkūje ūlū gūūshikīīla ū mhayo gwako?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūnshokeja alīhaya, “Lyaakī ī lina lyane ūlīlībūja? Ī lyoi līlī lya kūkumya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Manoa ūsola kabūli kasongi, hamò na shakwinha sha būsu; ī shose shenīsho ūshitūūla hiwe, ūshifunya kūbiza shakwinha kūlī SEEBA. Ū SEEBA wīta mhayo gwa kūkumya, ū Manoa nū nke balolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūlali lwa moto aho lūlībūūka kwīnga a ha ng'walīlo kūlinha kūja kwigūlū, ū Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA ūīlanīja ū mu lūlali lwenūlo! Ū Manoa nū nke aho baagūbona ū mhayo gwenūyo, būūgwa bachimīgije būlamya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbyalwa kwa ng'wa Samsoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika o ng'wa SEEBA atizile hangī ū kū ba Manoa nū nke; ū gwenūyo gūng'winha ū Manoa kūdeeba gīkī ū ng'wenūyo walī malaika o ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla ū nke gīkī, “Tūkūcha gete, nguno twamonaga Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nke ūnshokeja alīhaya, “Ītī gīko, ū SEEBA ūlū ni walī atogilwe kūtūbūlaga ni atazunije kwanukūla shakwinha sha kūpemva, na sha būsu kūfuma mu nkono gwise, ni atatoolekegije ī mihayo ī yose yenīyī; nūūlū ū kūtūwīla īyo watūwīla ī haha īyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūbyala ng'wana ngosha, būng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Samsoni; ū nyanda ūkūla, nīyo ū SEEBA ūng'wīlūkīla no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
